        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 4 }}>
            <Image src='assets/pipeline_roadmap.png' style={{ width: 1040, height: 504, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>
            图：docs/pipeline_roadmap.svg（矢量源），figures/pipeline_roadmap.png（2 倍位图）
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                全篇各页都能在这张图里找到位置；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>三条纪律</span>（只评验证集、test 一次、失败组留痕）写在右下角。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
